IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `wc-family`

-- Women's Charter 1961, ss 6A, 9-13, 17, 21A, 60, 60A, 63C, 69, 93-95A -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_womens-charter-1961.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`an ordinary registered marriage` MEANS Marriage WITH
    `age of the younger party` IS 25
