#ASSERT `the marriage is void` `a paid marriage for an immigration advantage`
#ASSERT NOT `the marriage is void` `a paid immigration marriage both believed genuine`
#ASSERT `the marriage is void` `a Singapore wedding without a licence`
#ASSERT NOT `the marriage is void` `an overseas wedding without a Singapore licence`

